{"sha": "669ab32935e7dbdf44254b20edb1ef71ac1b5b9f3d1b336329936eab45a1b63f", "body": ["\\chapter{不可逆变化}\\label{ch:g5:irreversible-changes}", "", "把一个鸡蛋打进热锅里。几秒钟内，清亮、稀薄的", "蛋清变得坚硬发白，蛋黄也凝固变稠。把锅从炉灶上拿下，", "让鸡蛋冷却，再放进冰箱：它永远不会再变回生鸡蛋。有些变化可以恢复，有些则不能。", "分辨它们，", "是化学学习的第一步。", "", "\\begin{recall}", "溶于水的固体并没有消失：水干了以后，", "固体会留下来（见\\cref{ch:g2:mixing-and-dissolving}）。", "燃烧会生成新的物质——灰烬、烟、二氧化碳和水蒸气——", "燃料也就永远消失了（见\\cref{ch:g4:what-a-fire-needs}）。", "\\end{recall}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.55\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g5-egg-frying.jpg}", "", "{\\small 煎蛋：清亮的蛋清已经变得坚硬发白，", "再也无法复原。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{可逆变化}", "", "\\begin{definition}[可逆变化]\\label{def:g5:irreversible-changes:reversible}", "称\\emph{可逆变化}\\index{可逆变化}为能够", "被逆转、从而恢复到最初状态的变化。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[溶解与蒸发]\\label{ex:g5:irreversible-changes:dissolve}", "把糖搅拌进水中，糖会溶解。让水蒸发，", "糖会重新出现：还是原来的糖，依然一样甜。溶解", "是一种可逆变化。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[冰与水]\\label{ex:g5:irreversible-changes:ice}", "把一块冰放在温热的盘子上，会熔化成水；把水放进", "冷冻室里，水又会变回冰。熔化和凝固都是", "可逆变化。（水为什么会熔化和凝固，在物理书中讲。）", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[混合]\\label{ex:g5:irreversible-changes:mix}", "与砾石混合的沙子可以用筛子重新分开；浑浊的水", "可以过滤。混合是可逆变化：没有生成新物质，", "各部分都能被分离（见\\cref{ch:g3:separating-mixtures}）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{不可逆变化}", "", "\\begin{definition}[不可逆变化与化学变化]\\label{def:g5:irreversible-changes:chemical-change}", "称\\emph{不可逆变化}\\index{不可逆变化}为", "不能简单恢复的变化。大多数此类变化中，会出现", "原本不存在的新物质：这类变化称为", "\\emph{化学变化}\\index{化学变化}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[六种化学变化]\\label{ex:g5:irreversible-changes:six}", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\textbf{煮鸡蛋}：稀薄、透明的蛋清变成", "        坚硬发白。", "  \\item \\textbf{烤蛋糕}：稀薄的面糊变成", "        松软的蛋糕，外皮呈褐色，并带有新的气味。", "  \\item \\textbf{燃烧}：木材变成", "        灰烬、烟、二氧化碳和水蒸气。", "  \\item \\textbf{生锈}：露在雨中的光亮铁器变成", "        覆盖着一层橙褐色的片状物质——铁锈。", "  \\item \\textbf{牛奶变酸}：放置数天后，牛奶变稠、", "        结块，并散发出酸味。", "  \\item \\textbf{切开的苹果变褐}：浅色果肉在", "        空气中一小时内就变成褐色。", "\\end{itemize}", "每一种情况下都生成了新物质，而且无法", "简单地恢复到最初的状态。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.48\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth,height=4.6cm,keepaspectratio]{images/book1/ai/g5-cake-before-after.jpg}", "", "{\\small 烤前为面糊，烤后为蛋糕：烘烤不可逆转。}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.48\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth,height=4.6cm,keepaspectratio]{images/book1/ai/g5-apple-browning.jpg}", "", "{\\small 刚切开的一半苹果，与在空气中放置一小时的另一半。}", "\\end{minipage}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\node[font=\\small\\bfseries, omDef] at (2.7,4.6) {可逆};", "  \\node[font=\\small\\bfseries, omProp] at (9.6,4.6) {不可逆};", "  \\draw[black!30] (6.1,4.9) -- (6.1,-0.3);", "  % reversible pairs", "  \\foreach \\y/\\a/\\b in {3.6/{sugar + water}/{sugar water}, 2.0/{ice}/{liquid water},", "                        0.4/{sand + gravel}/{a mix}} {", "    \\node[draw=omDef, fill=omDef!6, rounded corners=2pt, minimum width=2.3cm,", "      minimum height=0.8cm] at (0.9,\\y) {\\a};", "    \\node[draw=omDef, fill=omDef!6, rounded corners=2pt, minimum width=2.3cm,", "      minimum height=0.8cm] at (4.6,\\y) {\\b};", "    \\draw[->, thick, omDef] (2.3,\\y+0.12) -- (3.25,\\y+0.12);", "    \\draw[<-, thick, omDef] (2.3,\\y-0.12) -- (3.25,\\y-0.12);", "  }", "  % irreversible ones", "  \\foreach \\y/\\a/\\b in {3.6/{raw egg}/{cooked egg}, 2.0/{wood}/{ash, smoke, gases},", "                        0.4/{iron}/{rust}} {", "    \\node[draw=omProp, fill=omProp!6, rounded corners=2pt, minimum width=2.0cm,", "      minimum height=0.8cm] at (7.6,\\y) {\\a};", "    \\node[draw=omProp, fill=omProp!6, rounded corners=2pt, minimum width=2.9cm,", "      minimum height=0.8cm] at (11.5,\\y) {\\b};", "    \\draw[->, thick, omProp] (8.8,\\y) -- (9.85,\\y);", "  }", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}